  "score_rationale": "BWXT earns a high-quality score due to its essentially unassailable competitive moat as the sole-source supplier of naval nuclear components and fuel to the U.S. Government, reinforced by 100+ years of operating history and classified technical barriers; however, margin compression over recent quarters, meaningful leverage, and customer concentration in a single government program temper the score from exceptional levels.",
  "key_findings": [
    {
      "finding": "BWXT operates as the dominant sole-source provider of precision naval nuclear components and fuel to the U.S. Navy/NNSA, creating a near-irreplaceable competitive position with no credible domestic substitute.",
